 let scratchBytes=0,scratchEntries=0;const scratchFiles=[];function visit(directory){for(const name of fs.readdirSync(directory).sort()){const file=directory+'/'+name,stat=fs.lstatSync(file);assert(!stat.isSymbolicLink());scratchEntries++;if(stat.isDirectory())visit(file);else{const bytes=read(file);scratchBytes+=bytes.length;scratchFiles.push({path:path.relative(reviewRoot,file),bytes:bytes.length,sha256:hash(bytes)});}}}visit(reviewRoot+'/work');json('SCRATCH-SNAPSHOT.json',{domain:'owned work only',at:new Date().toISOString(),bytes:scratchBytes,entries:scratchEntries,files:scratchFiles});
 const lines=programs.cases.map(row=>'- '+row.id+': `'+row.program+'`').join('\n');
 fs.writeFileSync(reviewRoot+'/REPORT.md',`# Typed PIPESTATUS six-native preexecution review\n\n**${receipt.decision}. No native authority or expected outputs.**\n\nRetained D01–D12: ${counts.retainedPass}/12, ${retainedAssertions} unchanged assertions. Independent N01–N08: ${counts.novelPass}/8, ${counts.novelAssertions} assertions. One PURE helper; zero harmless lifecycle fixtures, Bash, product, Worker or async-loader starts. Fresh regular-file/size/hash/mode admission precedes helper imports and repeats after controls; four tools stream-hashed as DATA. Initial edit API NUL rejection occurred before any OS process and remains separately disclosed, not a fabricated process capture.\n\n## Exact literals\n${lines}\n\nP19 has no prologue. Only fixed f invocations, shell builtins/declarations/assignments and two finite pipelines occur; no source/eval/variable-command/slash or failed lookup allowed. Empty stdin, zero fixtures, all file effects refused including old F05. No output/type/readonly policy inferred.\n\n## Source and lifetime scope\nThree modules changed: admission/entry/observation; six capture/lifecycle/group-observer/observer-state/state/storage bodies retain parent bytes. Parent SHA256 plus Git-blob identities authenticated against native26 source. Entry catch/finally tail unchanged; limits, FD validation and authenticated-start guards precede case launch. No fresh lifecycle fixture was needed for byte-identical ownership machinery; no old groups probed.\n\n## Pending actual authority\nFresh typed runtime review, ROOT GO and preprovision must be committed/pinned. UTC issued/expiry/latest-full600s-start remain PENDING. Fresh owned parents/empty journal and initially absent bootstrap captures required; actual descriptor/inode/read validation deferred. Resolve only ROOT_APPROVED_GRANT_SHA256 in command template ${commandSha256}, obtain separate DATA slot review and exact require_escalated/login:false/no-prefix approval. No automatic activation.\n\nActual proposal600s inclusive/setup60/tail60/case3/TERM2/KILL1;29slots=7managed+4UNOBSERVEDstage reservations+18admin, peak5 proposal,32MiBcapture/128MiBwork/64KiBstreams. Not OS quota/universal census. Initial tool-shell startup trusted outside child fresh-env/capture qualification; no GNU5.3/fullBash claim. Older observations/source gaps/historical holds remain unchanged.\n`,{flag:'wx',mode:384});
